## Spawning subagents

Prefer token saving:

- Haiku: Predefined, easy finding, browsing tasks
- Sonnet: Average, general, more complex tasks that might need a bit of reasoning, prefer this most of the time
- Opus: Complex, reasoning-heavy, brainstorming tasks that require more context and memory
